---
description: Astro components & styling rules
globs: src/**/*.astro,src/styles/**,src/lib/**
---

- Reuse existing components + `src/styles/tokens.css` before adding new ones; no
  CSS framework, no ad-hoc colours/spacing.
- HTML-first: static by default; add `<script>` only for real interactivity;
  respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- A11y: one `<h1>` per page, semantic landmarks, keyboard focus, `alt` text.
- Data UI: handle loading/empty/error/success; lazy + size below-fold images (no CLS).
- Route pages through `BaseLayout`; keep `Seo.astro` meta/JSON-LD/canonical intact.
